---
description: "Postgres schema and migration constraints."
alwaysApply: false
globs: "**/migrations/**/*.sql,**/queries/**/*.sql,**/db/**/*.{ts,js,py},**/models/**/*.{ts,js,py},**/repositories/**/*.{ts,js,py}"
---

# DB Postgres

- All schema changes must use migrations (no manual edits).
- Migrations must be reversible or explicitly marked irreversible.
- Add indexes for query-critical paths.
- Use transactions for multi-step changes.
